From: Leo <62428370+LeoooChen@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: ethernet: require the bridge for the XRAM driver

The flow engine is linked into the XRAM driver unconditionally and calls
the bridge FDB and VLAN helpers. Depend on BRIDGE so the driver cannot be
built without those symbols.

Signed-off-by: Leo <62428370+LeoooChen@users.noreply.github.com>
---
--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/realtek/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/realtek/Kconfig
@@ -18,7 +18,8 @@ config RTL9617C_XRAM_ETH
 	tristate "RTL9617C management XRAM Ethernet"
 	depends on OF && ARCH_RTL9617C
 	depends on LEDS_CLASS
+	depends on BRIDGE
 	select PHYLINK
 	select CRC32
 	select NETFILTER
 	select NETFILTER_INGRESS
